# Optional, dev-only: set to 1 to skip the login screen with a fake local
# session, for testing screens that require being signed in (map, levels,
# modals) without a real account. Economy RPCs will fail server-side with
# this fake session — expected. Leave unset/0 for real account testing.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_DEV_SKIP_AUTH=1
